  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "We have the following network architecture:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "FEDORASERVER:8015 <------> YYY:ROUTER:80 <----> XXX:INTERNET",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "As you can see, our router redirects all requests to the fedora server mapping port 80 to port 8015.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Fedora replies have the protocol, host and port harcoded, but these values are extracted from the last hop and are of the form ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://fedoraserver:8015/fedora/"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://FEDORASERVER:8015/fedora/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ".... These URL's are not accessible from the outside.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Examples of requests with the problem:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "http://fedoraserver/fedora/get/pidns:134/fedora-system:3/viewItemIndex"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "http://fedoraserver/fedora/get/pidns:134/fedora-system:3/viewItemIndex",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "http://fedoraserver/fedora/get/pidns:134/DS"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "http://fedoraserver/fedora/get/pidns:134/DS",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "http://fedoraserver/fedora/get/pidns:134/fedora-system:3/viewMethodIndex"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "http://fedoraserver/fedora/get/pidns:134/fedora-system:3/viewMethodIndex",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In order to solve the problem we suggest to remove the method 'getReposBaseURL' from classes 'DefaultAccess.java' and 'DynamicAccessImpl.java'. We don't know if these changes can cause a undesired behaviour. Use at your own risk.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Regards, Gerard",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
