     "body": "<p>The solution for \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-406\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-406\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Remove assumption of /fedora as webapp path\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-406\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n may already be helping with the viewItem/MethodIndex pages, but this needs to be verified.</p>\n\n<p>Gerard, can you clarify where in the body of ../pidns:134/DS your Fedora URL is being hardcoded?</p>",
