       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/eaebed23b99270858f5b29f9bd1499a3?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FGT-6.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/eaebed23b99270858f5b29f9bd1499a3?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FGT-6.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Gerard Torrent",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4c55797db006993ff53",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>In any of the html pages responded by:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"http://fedoraserver/fedora/get/pid/fedora-system:3/viewItemIndex\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedoraserver/fedora/get/pid/fedora-system:3/viewItemIndex</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://fedoraserver/fedora/get/pid/DS\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedoraserver/fedora/get/pid/DS</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://fedoraserver/fedora/get/pid/fedora-system:3/viewMethodIndex\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedoraserver/fedora/get/pid/fedora-system:3/viewMethodIndex</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>we found tags like this:<br/>\n&lt;a href='http://FEDORASERVER:8015/fedora/xxx'&gt;blablabla&lt;/a&gt;</p>\n\n<p>This href is an absolute reference with the port of the last hop (<a href=\"http://FEDORASERVER:8015\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://FEDORASERVER:8015</a>). We can't access to this port from outside, we only can access to port 80. We propose to change these references in a relative form, like this:<br/>\n&lt;a href='/fedora/xxx'&gt;blablabla&lt;/a&gt;</p>",
     "created": "15/Apr/09 5:05 AM",
